ty\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): PyTorch training on ROCm is supported for single- and multi-GPU jobs admitted through Kueue, with amd.com/gpu quota handling (job/runtime portion).\n\n## Risks\n\n- Validation requires physical AMD Instinct hardware; node access (procurement or partner lab) is an availability precondition granted outside the strategy and is not an acceptance criterion.\n- PyTorch ROCm image releases are upstream-controlled and may not align with platform release trains.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":51491,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b885a4284ba31d43","agent_id":"a494e83127aea9e39","session_id":"0cf99ff6-f962-401b-a34e-cfcb3645e2fd","uuid":"f0e1ae6e-6f29-4665-afbb-7f054cdf922c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:34:05.267Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020"}
