n results.\n50\t- Driver prerequisites: the required ROCm/driver stack versions for serving and training.\n51\t- Validated model list: the models cleared by the validation campaign and served by the productized vLLM ROCm runtime.\n52\t- Usage guidance for PyTorch training on ROCm: single- and multi-GPU jobs admitted through Kueue with amd.com/gpu quota.\n53\t- Limits and exclusions carried from the strategy: other accelerator families and AMD GPU sharing/partitioning are out of scope and not implied as supported.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Documentation states the supported AMD hardware and the driver/ROCm prerequisites for both serving and training.\n58\t- Documentation states the validated model list, consistent with the campaign's go/no-go scope and what was productized.\n59\t- Documentation includes the prerequisites and usage notes for PyTorch ROCm training jobs (single- and multi-GPU through Kueue with amd.com/gpu quota).\n60\t- Content is technically reviewed against the implemented capability before publication.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-4 (P2): documentation states supported AMD hardware, driver prerequisites, and the validated model list. The epic's priority is P1 via the docs-authoring priority exception (strategy frontmatter priority Major → P1).\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd0bb8b882efc9cf","agent_id":"a8f1c7235544b55fc","session_id":"0cf99ff6-f962-401b-a34e-cfcb3645e2fd","uuid":"aa6b99a1-c3ae-466a-a6ae-f5c317b6dd76","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:43:10.885Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-893a78027ac3ceee","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9020 decomposition"}
